"slug":"sapidity","name":"Sapidity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sapidity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Spirit born of the meals people cook every day. Everything picked up by the chopsticks—joy or sorrow, mirth or anger—is a slice of life.","abilities":["Unblockable; Moves towards <Stoves> and can be absorbed by them, increasing their SP","Must be damaged 5 times to defeat; Spawns 1 <Vapidity> when defeated","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter; Automatically moves towards <Stoves>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":5,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.7}},"vapidity":{"slug":"vapidity","name":"Vapidity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Vapidity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the meals people discard. Put down the cup and lay aside the chopsticks. All is meaningless, and the meal on the plate vapid.","abilities":["Unblockable; Moves towards <Derelict Stoves> and can be absorbed by them, increasing their SP","Must be damaged 15 times to defeat; Spawns 1 <Sapidity> when defeated","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter; Automatically moves towards <Derelict Stoves>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.7}},"profanity":{"slug":"profanity","name":"Profanity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Profanity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Originally a clay pot that broke someone's skull, itself undamaged. The dinner table has always been a place for squabbles. Tables are flipped and pots are broken, but in the end, everyone might still have to sit back down and eat together.","abilities":["Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Sapidity>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":500,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"humility":{"slug":"humility","name":"'Humility'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Humility'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A drink reveals one's true nature and inspires deep conversations. Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Often appears in drunken squabbles, but usually disappears once one is sober.","abilities":["Pulls 1 <Sapidity> within range towards itself, causing it to lose HP proportionate to distance moved when shifted"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":550,"def":300,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"bloated":{"slug":"bloated","name":"'Bloated'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Bloated'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Originally a hardened vessel for holding the five grains. The five grains are fundamental to sating hunger, and the vessel that stores them must not only be solid and heavy, but also exceptionally tough.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":800,"def":4000,"res":90,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"drifting_aroma":{"slug":"drifting_aroma","name":"Drifting Aroma","icon":"/enemies-icons/Drifting Aroma.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null